# Backend Technical Documentation

## When this applies

Write or update docs when:

- New feature, model change, or business workflow change
- API behavior changes beyond a trivial fix
- User explicitly asks for backend technical docs

**Skip** for pure internal refactors with no behavior, model, or contract change.

## Location

`<app>/docs/backend/<feature-name>.md` (kebab-case).

Full-document outline (integration guide)
What is this feature? (plain language + example)
Who uses which flow? (roles)
Mental model / important rules
Auth, headers, base path, permissions, QR formats
Full workflow A (numbered steps, API-by-API)
Full workflow B if a second role exists
Optional / helper endpoints
Status values glossary
Global error shape + cheat sheet
Quick checklist
How to verify (seed + tests)
Links to OpenSpec / backend technical notes
