## Must-include outline

1. Quick summary & endpoint grid
2. Permissions matrix
3. Key models / fields involved
4. Business validation rules
5. Request/response examples for main flows
6. Error codes / HTTP status map
7. State transitions (if any) — table or mermaid
8. How to verify (Swagger steps mapping to automated tests when known)


